  m_Name: Question3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MCQQuestionData
  questionText: 3. What is the transition level?
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: The transition level is the lowest usable flight level above the
    transition altitude. It ensures that aircraft using standard pressure settings
    remain safely separated from aircraft using local altimeter settings.
  options:
  - The first available flight level above the transition altitude
  - The highest flight level available below the transition altitude
  - The top of the ATZ
  - The level at which 1013 is set
  correctOptionIndex: 0
